        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-equus-quagga-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-rmse-of-pde-wavelength-against-analytical-lambda-c>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-equus-quagga-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-flank-gradient-angle>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-equus-quagga-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-flank-stripe-period>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-equus-quagga-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-specimen-structure-tensor-coherency>,
